  "title": "Momma’s Wheat Germ Cookies",
  "description": "Momma’s wheat germ cookie recipe includes oatmeal, wheat germ, flaked coconut, chopped pecans, and chopped pitted dates. The recipe yields 5 dozen.",
  "authors": [
    "Donna Newland"
  ],
